{"candidateAnswer":"Sometime in the summer of 2023","evidence":"[D3:19 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: It's Seattle, I'm stoked for my game there next month! It's one of my favorite cities to explore - super vibrant!\n[D5:2 | 10:29 am on 9 August, 2023] John: Hi Tim! Nice to hear from you. Glad you could reconnect. As for me, lots of stuff happened since we last talked. Last week I had a crazy game - crazy intense! We won it by a tight score. Scoring that last basket and hearing the crowd cheer was awesome!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6fc4005f-5994-5f08-89c2-c4fd96e9c3ab","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6cadbc8b37468a81bb87f23e61e36dbe2ad2acafcd8edf107cf93e1face28eba","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When was John in Seattle for a game?","referenceAnswer":"early August, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6cadbc8b37468a81bb87f23e61e36dbe2ad2acafcd8edf107cf93e1face28eba"}}]}